Sure! To submit a vote for the IP address **22.242.75.136** indicating it’s malicious, we’ll need to make a POST request to VirusTotal’s voting endpoint:

```
POST https://www.virustotal.com/api/v3/ip_addresses/22.242.75.136/votes
Content-Type: application/json
x-apikey: <YOUR_API_KEY>

{
  "type": "vote",
  "attributes": {
    "verdict": "malicious"
  }
}
```

Could you please provide the value of your `key_four` (the API key) so I can include it in the request header? Once I have that, I can send the request for you.
